  m_text: "Made by\r\nRandy Simon\r\n\r\n\r\nFor Butters!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIn
    Memoriam\r\nSphinx Simon\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTank Spartacus Simon\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRTG
    Group:\r\nHatem Mehana\r\nLouay \r\n\r\nUI/UX Design:\r\nRandy Simon\r\nDrake
    Poling\r\nBlue Makara\r\n\r\n3D Modelers:\r\nJano Martin\r\nRandy Simon\r\n\r\n\r\nTexture
    Artists:\r\nJano Martin\r\nRandy Simon\r\nBlue Makara\r\n\r\n\r\nConcept Designers:\r\nRandy
    Simon\r\nJano Martin\r\nBlue Makara\r\nRobert Volpe\r\n\r\nProgrammers:\r\nRandy
    Simon\r\nDrake Poling\r\nSaika Kisami\r\nMichael Feng\r\n\r\nQuality Assurance
    Engineer:\r\nTJay Cargle\r\n\r\nVoice Acting:\r\nRandy Simon\r\nButters Scotch
    Simon\r\n\r\nSound Effects:\r\nDax Goren\r\nCrystal Stull\r\nMichael Rose\r\nRandy
    Simon\r\n\r\nMarketing team:\r\nCharanda Wissink\r\nTifany Gonzalez\r\nBlue Makara\r\nMohammed
    Alihasan\r\nCarl Mineck\r\n\r\nAdditional Assets:\r\nRobots a Cometh by Dan Lebowitz\r\nWarzone
    by Anno Domini Beats\r\nWe Ride! by Reed Mathis\r\nFlying by Track Tribe\r\nLittle
    Sambas by Quincas Moreira\r\nLike it Loud by Dyalla\r\nThe Urban Groove by Hanu
    Dixit\r\nOld World Saga by Hanu Dixit\r\nDance of the Gypsies by Hanu Dixit\r\nSlipping
    Away by Dyalla\r\nRingside by Dyalla\r\nSweet Math by Mini Vandals\r\nMinor Lament
    for Solo Bass by John Patitucci\r\nWhen You're Not Looking by Jason Moore\r\nPrincess
    Butters sound by Pixabay\r\nJerry can model by abazibiz on Sketchfab\r\nTiara
    model by Que3D on Sketchfab\r\nLock graphic by Timplaru Emil\r\nPoodle model
    by Yahoo Japan\r\nPub model by Michael on Creazilla\r\nTessellation shader by
    NedMakesGames\r\nKitchen set by miska-tervo5\r\nIED by nicmacanimations on Sketchfab\r\nLava
    Texture by Katsukagi on 3dTextures\r\nCrashed spaceship by osmosikum on Sketchfab\r\nFerret
    by omarflor on Turbosquid\r\nsmoke poof by Freepik\r\n\r\nToolset:\r\nUnity 6000\r\nAutodesk
    Maya 2026\r\nArmorpaint\r\nArmorlab\r\nClip Studio Paint\r\nAdobe Creative Suite\r\ntextures.com\r\n\r\nThanks
    to my volunteer testers!\r\nJosh Simon\r\nCarl Mineck\r\nDan Snyder\r\nBlue Makara\r\n\r\nThis
    is Simeck Entertainment's first \r\npublished game, and I did not start \r\nproduction
    with the intent of getting this \r\nfar. Some credits may have fallen through
    \r\nthe cracks.\r\nPlease let me know if I missed you."
